# GeoVision — docker build context exclusions
#
# WHY: without this, `docker build` uploads dataset/, models/, outputs/ and
# node_modules/ into the build context — gigabytes, on every single build.
# Keeping the context small is the single biggest build-speed win available.

# Version control & docs
.git/
.github/
GeoVision-Vault/
thesis/
documentation/
*.md
!README.md

# Large data & artifacts — never needed at image build time
dataset/
models/
outputs/

# Local environments
.venv/
venv/
node_modules/
dashboard/dist/
.pio/

# Caches
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# Secrets — belt and braces; these must never enter an image layer
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# Editor / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
